            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li>The progress rope keeps one length while an update runs: changing percentages and buttons no longer stretch or shrink it.</li>
  <li>Cursor updates come from Cursor&#x27;s own update service (3.29.9 while Homebrew had 3.28.7), marked &quot;From Keel&#x27;s catalog&quot;.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
